        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use of fixed IP access network per hour</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use of fixed IP access network per hour
The data set represents the mix of fixed network in Switzerland; UUID: 2bad20d4-c914-375a-ab3c-51f90a21bfda
The datasets represents the split of fixed networks (cable, optic fibre, xDSL) in Switzerland for the reference year of 2014. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: The mix of Swiss access transmission network, fixed.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2bad20d4-c914-375a-ab3c-51f90a21bfda.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
